# Repo-root scratch logs from ad-hoc dev/verification commands
# (dev servers, pytest/vitest/lint/pip-install runs, push/pull retries, etc.)
# — these should be redirected outside the repo, but ignore them here too
# so they stop accumulating as untracked clutter at the repo root.
/dev_*.log
/pytest_*.log
/vitest_*.log
/lint_*.log
/pip_install_*.log
/pull_*.log
/push_*.log
/prod_*.html

